WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.595
Every machine in this plant stores energy.

2
00:00:03.595 --> 00:00:09.073
When someone reaches into a machine
that starts up unexpectedly,

3
00:00:09.073 --> 00:00:11.298
the result is amputations,

4
00:00:11.298 --> 00:00:13.866
crushing injuries, and deaths.

5
00:00:13.866 --> 00:00:19.772
OSHA's lockout/tagout standard, 29
CFR 1910.147, exists to stop that.

6
00:00:19.772 --> 00:00:23.795
OSHA estimates that
following it prevents about

7
00:00:23.795 --> 00:00:27.390
120 deaths and 50,000 injuries every year.

8
00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:31.156
In the next five minutes
you'll learn how to

9
00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:34.751
make a machine safe before you work on it,

10
00:00:34.751 --> 00:00:37.747
and keep it safe until you're done.
